<title>USA: Long Island Lighting names new president.</title>
<headline>Long Island Lighting names new president.</headline>
<dateline>HICKSVILLE, N.Y. 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Long Island Lighting Co said on Wednesday it named Executive Vice President James Flynn president and a member of the board of directors.</p>
<p>The position had been vacant, the company said.</p>
<p>Flynn, 62, joined LILCO in October 1986, and has been executive vice president since April 1992, the utility said.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
